# sunstone: the USB gadget's network port (usb0, NCM to the test host) is not a modem. Without this
# ModemManager probes it whenever it appears and logs "Missing port probe for port (net/usb0)" every few
# minutes (seen 2026-10-27).
ACTION=="add|change|move|bind", SUBSYSTEM=="net", DEVPATH=="*/gadget.*/net/*", ENV{ID_MM_DEVICE_IGNORE}="1"
